## 🚀 **Recovery Procedures**

### Complete Environment Reset
```bash
# Nuclear option - complete reset
rm -rf node_modules package-lock.json
{{#if project.technologies.frontend}}
rm -rf .next dist build
{{/if}}
npm install
npm run build
```

### Database Recovery
{{#if project.technologies.database}}
```bash
# Backup first!
{{#each project.technologies.database}}
{{#ifEquals this "MongoDB"}}
mongodump --out backup-$(date +%Y%m%d)
{{/ifEquals}}
{{#ifEquals this "PostgreSQL"}}
pg_dump {{project.name}} > backup-$(date +%Y%m%d).sql
{{/ifEquals}}
{{/each}}

# Reset development database
npm run db:reset
npm run db:migrate
npm run db:seed
```
{{/if}}

### Cache Clearing
```bash
# Clear all caches
npm cache clean --force
{{#if project.technologies.frontend}}
rm -rf .next
{{/if}}
{{#if project.technologies.backend}}
rm -rf dist
{{/if}}
```

